:{"urlSlug":"berlin"}},"movie":{"id":"1574965","title":"Black Christmas [OmU]","titleOriginal":null,"urlSlug":"black-christmas-omu","duration":98,"productionYear":null,"description":null,"contentRating":{"minimumAge":16},"productionCountries":[],"genres":[],"directors":[],"actors":[],"thumbnailImage":null,"trailers":[]}},{"name":"Block 10","beginning":"2026-11-30T18:00:00+01:00","urlSlug":"64563","deeplink":null,"flags":[],"subtitleLanguage":null,"auditorium":{"name":"Kino 2"},"cinema":{"urlSlug":"babylon-berlin","city":{"urlSlug":"berlin"}},"movie":{"id":"1580309","title":"Block 10","titleOriginal":"Block 10","urlSlug":"block-10","duration":108,"productionYear":null,"description":"Im Konzentrationslager Auschwitz wird Anfang 1943 ein Bereich geschaffen, der innerhalb des Stammlagers eine besondere Stellung einnimmt: Block 10. Hinter seinen Mauern sperrt die SS hunderte j\u00fcdische Frauen ein. Sie werden zu Objekten medizinischer Experimente, systematisch misshandelt, verst\u00fcmmelt und ihrer Zukunft beraubt.\r\nHier treffen unterschiedliche Schicksale aufeinander: Frauen, die ums \u00dcberleben k\u00e4mpfen, ihre W\u00fcrde behaupten und einander Halt geben. \u00c4rzte, die im Namen der Ideologie foltern und t\u00f6ten. Und H\u00e4ftlinge, die gezwungen werden, zwischen Anpassung und Widerstand zu w\u00e4hlen.\r\nUnter ihnen der j\u00fcdische Gyn\u00e4kologe Dr. Maximilian Samuel. Als H\u00e4ftlingsarzt muss er bei den Eingriffen assistieren. Die SS zwingt ihn zur Mitarbeit, andernfalls droht der Tod seiner Tochter. Sein pers\u00f6nliches Dilemma spiegelt die moralische Grauzone wider, in der sich viele Gefangene bewegen: zwischen Zwang, Schuld und dem verzweifelten Versuch, Leben zu retten.","contentRating":{"minimumAge":16},"productionCountries":[{"name":"Germany"}],"genres":[{"name":"Drama"}],"directors":[],"actors":[],"thumbnailImage":{"url":"https:\/\/static.kinoheld.de\/images\/film\/block-10-102987.v17861518023006.jpg"},"trailers":[{"url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=F6xNg55K3uU"}]}},{"name":"MetFilm @Babylon: Persepolis","beginning":"2026-12-03T20:00:00+01:00","urlSlug":"63965","deeplink":null,"flags":[],"subtitleLanguage":null,"auditorium":{"name":"Kino 2"},"cinema":{"urlSlug":"babylon-berlin","city":{"urlSlug":"berlin"}},"movie":{"id":"1550049","title":"MetFilm @Babylon: Persepolis","titleOriginal":null,"urlSlug":"metfilm-at-babylon-persepolis","duration":96,"productionYear":null,"description":null,"contentRating":{"minimumAge":12},"productionCountries":[],"genres":[],"directors":[],"actors":[],"thumbnailImage":null,"trailers":[]}},{"name":"CinemAperitivo: Italy: Punk State","beginning":"2026-12-06T16:00:00+01:00","urlSlug":"64567","deeplink":null,"flags":[],"subtitleLanguage":null,"auditorium":{"name":"Kino 2"},"cinema":{"urlSlug":"babylon-berlin","city":{"urlSlug":"berlin"}},"movie":{"id":"1580443","title":"CinemAperitivo: Italy: Punk State","titleOriginal":null,"urlSlug":"cinemaperitivo-italy-punk-state","duration":73,"productionYear":null,"description":null,"contentRating":null,"productionCountries":[],"genres":[],"directors":[],"actors":[],"thumbnailImage":null,"trailers":[]}},{"name":"Metropolis LIVE Babylon Orchester Berlin","beginning":"2026-12-06T18:00:00+01:00","urlSlug":"64266","deeplink":null,"flags":[],"subtitleLanguage":null,"auditorium":{"name":"Kino 1"},"cinema":{"urlSlug":"babylon-berlin","city":{"urlSlug":"berlin"}},"movie":{"id":"1439397","title":"Metropolis LIVE Babylon Orchester Berlin","titleOriginal":"Metropolis","urlSlug":"metropolis-live-babylon-orchester-berlin","duration":153,"productionYear":null,"description":"Wie kein anderer Film repr\u00e4sentiert METROPOLIS die Bl\u00fcte des deutschen Stummfilms made in Berlin \u2013 Babelsberg. Die Elektrizit\u00e4t brachte die Dinge in Bewegung, brachte die N\u00e4chte und den Asphalt zum Leuchten. Der Motor trieb das Automobil und das Aeroplan, mit dem Fahrstuhl wuchsen die Wolkenkratzer. Durch den Kinematographen wurde die Vision \/ Illusion einer zuk\u00fcnftigen Metropole an die wei\u00dfen W\u00e4nde der Kinopal\u00e4ste geworfen und das Volk stieg aus den Katakomben empor und forderte seinen gerechten Anteil. Eine neue \u00c4ra war geboren und wird durch das Babylon Orchester Berlin im 1929 gebauten Babylon in altem\/neuen Glanz auf der Gold umrahmten Leinwand zum Leben erweckt.<br>\r\nEine mitrei\u00dfende Zeitreise in die Vergangenheit, eine mitrei\u00dfende Zeitreise in die Zukunft.\r\n<br><br>\r\nLike no other film, METROPOLIS represents the heyday of the German silent film made in Berlin - Babelsberg. Electricity got things moving, lighting up the nights and the asphalt.<br> \r\nThe engine drove the car and the airplane, and the lift grew the skyscrapers. The cinematograph threw the vision \/ illusion of a future metropolis on the white walls of the cinema palaces and the people rose from the catacombs and demanded his fair share. A new era was born and is brought to life on the gold-framed canvas by the Babylon Orchestra Berlin in Babylon, built in 1929 in old \/ new splendor.\r\n","contentRating":{"minimumAge":6},"productionCountries":[],"genres":[],"directors":[],"actors":[],"thumbnailImage":{"url":"https:\/\/static.kinoheld.de\/images\/film\/metropolis-live-babylon-orchester-berlin-22851.v2.jpg"},"trailers":[]}},{"name":"Literatur Live mit Francesca Albanese: Wenn die Welt schl\u00e4ft","beginning":"2026-12-10T19:30:00+01:00","urlSlug":"64398","deeplink":null,"flags":[],"subtitleLanguage":null,"auditorium":{"name":"Kino 1"},"cinema":{"urlSlug":"babylon-berlin","city":{"urlSlug":"berlin"}},"movie":{"id":"1572171","title":"Literatur Live mit Francesca Albanese: Wenn die Welt schl\u00e4ft","titleOriginal":null,"urlSlug":"literatur-live-mit-francesca-albanese-wenn-die-welt-schlaft","duration":100,"productionYear":null,"description":null,"contentRating":null,"productionCountries":[],"genres":[],"directors":[],"actors":[],"thumbnailImage":null,"trailers":[]}},{"name":"Metropolis LIVE Baby